OL,3,CDuke of Sussex's case against Mail
OL,4,Cpublisher to return to court after
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FThe claims of several high-profile
OL,8,Ffigures, including the Duke of Sussex,
OL,9,Fagainst the publisher of the Daily
OL,10,FMail are set to return to court on
OL,11,FWednesday after a High Court judge
OL,12,Fdismissed their cases earlier this
OL,13,Fmonth.
OL,15,FThe group of seven household names,
OL,16,Fwhich also includes Sir Elton John and
OL,17,FBaroness Doreen Lawrence, sued
OL,18,FAssociated Newspapers Limited (ANL)
OL,19,Fover allegations of unlawful
OL,20,Finformation-gathering.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785309491
OL,3,CDuke of Sussex's case against Mail
OL,4,Cpublisher to return to court after
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FANL strongly denied the claims, which
OL,8,Fwere heard at an 11-week trial in
OL,9,FLondon earlier this year.
OL,11,FOn July 7, Mr Justice Nicklin
OL,12,Fdismissed the claims in their entirety
OL,13,Fin a 436-page judgment.
OL,15,FThe claims are now set to return to
OL,16,Fcourt on Wednesday for a two-day
OL,17,Fhearing dealing with consequential
OL,18,Fmatters arising from the judgment
OL,19,Fwhich is due to begin at 10.30am.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785309491
OL,3,CDuke of Sussex's case against Mail
OL,4,Cpublisher to return to court after
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FThe hearing is expected to concern
OL,8,Fissues including legal costs, with ANL
OL,9,Fstating it has already run up costs of
OL,10,Fmore than #50 million, and whether any
OL,11,Fof the group will seek to appeal
OL,12,Fagainst the ruling.
OL,14,FThe trial was focused on 97 articles
OL,15,Fthat the group claimed were sourced
OL,16,Fthrough unlawful means.
OL,18,FDozens of people gave evidence during
OL,19,Fthe trial, including all of the high-
OL,20,Fprofile figures and many current or
OL,21,Fformer ANL journalists and executives.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
