OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785309491
OL,3,CDuke of Sussex's case against Mail
OL,4,Cpublisher to return to court after
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FBut lawyers for the publisher said
OL,8,Fthat Daily Mail and Mail on Sunday
OL,9,Fjournalists provided a "compelling
OL,10,Faccount of a pattern of legitimate
OL,11,Fsourcing of articles", including
OL,12,Ffriends and "leaky" social circles,
OL,13,Fpress officers and spokespersons, as
OL,14,Fwell as previous reporting, freelance
OL,15,Fjournalists and stories from other
OL,16,Fnewspapers and news agencies.
OL,26,@qD@XOUsD@UO]tD@MOUtD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
